      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Primary embryonal rhabdomyosarcoma of the orbit is an extremely rare tumor in adults. A 38 year old female patient with immunohistochemically proved embryonal rhabdomyosarcoma of the right orbit is reported. The histologic types, diagnosis, management and out come of rhabdomyosarcoma is discussed."},
